{"href":null,"image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Slider%20Image/DCORE-Home-delivery-1040x200.jpg.webp","alt":"Home Delivery","width":0,"height":0}},"title":"D CORE LT-110H Bluetooth Label Maker With QWERTY Keyboard","stats":[{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Regular Price : 6,500৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Product ID : 342","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"product-stock in-stock","label":"Status:","value":"In Stock","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-manufacturer","label":"Brands:","value":"D CORE","href":"/dcore","plain":false},{"cls":"product-model","label":"Model:","value":"LT-110H","href":null,"plain":false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"","old":"","single":"6,500৳","tax":"Ex Tax: 6,500৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"342","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: LT-110H","c":[]},{"h":"Keyboard: Built-in QWERTY Keyboard","c":[]},{"h":"Connectivity: Bluetooth 4.0","c":[]},{"h":"Compatible Devices\tiOS / Android (Printer Master Andoird App Supported)","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h3 data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"296\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"296\">D CORE LT-110H Bluetooth Label Maker with QWERTY Keyboard – Smart, Portable Label Printing Solution</strong></h3><p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"671\" class=\"\">Take control of clutter and streamline your organization with the <strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"403\">D CORE LT-110H Bluetooth Label Maker</strong>, a compact, easy-to-use label printer ideal for home, office, school, and business use. Equipped with a <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"536\">built-in QWERTY keyboard</strong>, <strong data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"564\">Bluetooth connectivity</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"599\">ink-free thermal printing</strong>, this label maker delivers fast, high-quality labels—anytime, anywhere.</p><p data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"844\" class=\"\">Whether you're labeling files, jars, storage boxes, wires, or retail items, the D CORE LT-110H combines powerful features with a lightweight design for everyday efficiency.</p><hr data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"849\" class=\"\"><h3 data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"872\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"872\">Key Features:</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1584\">\n<li data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1022\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"1022\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"914\">Wireless Bluetooth Connectivity</strong><br data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"917\">\nConnects quickly to iOS and Android devices via the D CORE Label app for convenient, app-based printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1164\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1164\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1061\">QWERTY Keyboard &amp; LCD Screen</strong><br data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1064\">\nBuilt-in physical keyboard and screen allow standalone label creation—no phone or computer needed.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1303\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1303\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1201\">Ink-Free Thermal Printing</strong><br data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1204\">\nUses direct thermal printing technology—no ink, no mess, no hassle. Just load the tape and print.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1441\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1441\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1337\">Rechargeable &amp; Portable</strong><br data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1340\">\nUSB rechargeable battery supports long-lasting use. Compact and lightweight for on-the-go labeling.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1584\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1584\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1471\">Customizable Labels</strong><br data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1474\">\nChoose from multiple fonts, styles, icons, borders, and sizes to create professional or personalized labels.</p>\n</li>\n</ul><hr data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1589\" class=\"\"><h3 data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1622\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1622\">Product Specifications:</strong></h3><div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\"><table data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"2778\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1700\"><tr data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1700\"><th data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1652\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1643\">Specification</strong></th><th data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1700\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1665\">Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"2778\"><tr data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1854\"><td data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1806\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1789\">Brand</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1854\">D CORE</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1931\"><td data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1883\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1866\">Model</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1931\">LT-110H</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"2008\"><td data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1960\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1946\">Keyboard</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2008\">Built-in QWERTY Keyboard</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2085\"><td data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2037\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2027\">Connectivity</strong></td><td da